// A transition from the body of an option that comes from an insertion leaves
// the whole insertion context: no epilogue of the inserted beat or of the parent
// runs afterwards, and the new beat runs with a clean stack.

beat Start
  choice
    Stay
      Stayed.
    + Side
  Back at start.

beat Side
  choice
    Leave for elsewhere
      Leaving.

      -> Elsewhere
  Back at side.

beat Elsewhere
  new state
    here: "elsewhere"

  Arrived $here, beat $current_beat().

  Elsewhere done.

/*
<test>
- choices: [0]
  expected: |
    + Stay
    + Leave for elsewhere

    ~ Stayed.

    ~ Back at start.
- choices: [1]
  expected: |
    + Stay
    + Leave for elsewhere

    ~ Leaving.

    ~ Arrived elsewhere, beat Elsewhere.

    ~ Elsewhere done.
- choices: [1]
  saveAtDialogue: 0
  expected: |
    + Stay
    + Leave for elsewhere

    ~ Leaving.

    ~ Leaving.

    ~ Arrived elsewhere, beat Elsewhere.

    ~ Elsewhere done.
- choices: [1]
  saveAtDialogue: [1, 2]
  expected: |
    + Stay
    + Leave for elsewhere

    ~ Leaving.

    ~ Arrived elsewhere, beat Elsewhere.

    ~ Arrived elsewhere, beat Elsewhere.

    ~ Elsewhere done.

    ~ Elsewhere done.
</test>
*/
